H0904.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Esther 2:21; also called Bigthana at Esther 6:2; 
§ Bigthan = "in their wine-press"
a eunuch in king Ahasuerus' (Xerxes) court

H0938G.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, only mentioned at Genèse 22:21; 
son of: Nahor (H5152H) and Milcah (H4435); 
brother of: Uz (H5780H), Kemuel (H7055), Chesed (H3777), Hazo (H2375), Pildash (H6394), Jidlaph (H3044) and Bethuel (H1328A); 
half-brother of: Tebah (H2875), Gaham (H1514), Tahash (H8477) and Maacah (H4601)
§ Buz = "contempt"
1) second son of Nahor, Abraham's nephew
2) a Gadite

H0942.def:
A man living at the time of Exile and Return, only mentioned at Néhémie 3:18; 
son of: Henadad (H2582H); also called in KJV: Bevai; in NIV: Binnui; 
§ Bavai = "my goings"
a rebuilder of Jerusalem's walls in Nehemiah's time

H0946.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:25; 
son of: Jerahmeel (H3396); 
brother of: Ram (H7410H), Oren (H0767), Ozem (H0684H), Ahijah (H0281J) and Onam (H0208H) 
§ Bunah = "intelligence"
a son of Jerahmeel, a Judahite
